WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.832
We are going through the airport. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.832 --> 00:00:12.240
We check our big bags at the desk. They travel under the plane.

3
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:17.808
At security, we put our bags and jacket in a grey tray.

4
00:00:17.808 --> 00:00:22.872
Liquids come out of our bag and go in a small clear bag.

5
00:00:22.872 --> 00:00:30.696
We walk through the scanner gate. It beeps sometimes. That is okay.

6
00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:36.264
A staff member might check our bag or tap our shoulders with a wand.

7
00:00:36.264 --> 00:00:42.576
We collect all our things and count them: bag, jacket, shoes.

8
00:00:42.576 --> 00:00:46.992
We find our gate number and wait there until boarding.

9
00:00:46.992 --> 00:00:55.200
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

